config TENSOR_TMU
	tristate "Google Tensor thermal management unit driver"
	depends on THERMAL_OF
	depends on HAS_IOMEM
	help
	  Direct-MMIO reader for the Google Tensor (gs101/gs201/zuma) TMU.
	  Reads the live CURRENT_TEMP/TRIMINFO registers (already powered and
	  calibrated by ACPM firmware) and exposes them as thermal zones.
